-- Arathi RPE: zone-wide spawn fill to observed peak concurrency (2026-08-22)
-- COUNT comes from PEAK CONCURRENT instances across both captures (never distinct GUIDs, which
-- count every respawn as a new creature). PLACEMENT is an observed position where one exists;
-- for WANDERERS with none left over, the spawn is distributed around that entry's existing
-- cluster at its own wander radius -- it roams from wherever it starts, so the error is bounded.
-- Stationary entries with no observed position are deliberately NOT filled (see report).
DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 8300000 AND 8300058;
